      },
      "lineNbr": 34,
      "author": {
        "id": 1018773
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-11-07T04:14:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Style: Typical preferred order of fields is static, followed by non-static. Within each group final followed by non-final. In this particular class, I\u0027d suggest separating final and non-final with an empty line. This\u0027ll make it easier to spot which bits of the class\u0027s state change and which don\u0027t.",
      "revId": "9ff20929e841a9514e6917db7ad1f3527ecd69a6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
