      },
      "lineNbr": 57,
      "author": {
        "id": 1018773
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-11-07T04:14:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suggest resetting all the fields that are populated by the initialization process. Scenario: First attempts fails half way through, second attempt is initiated. You don\u0027t want the partial state from the first attempt to influence the result of the second attempt.",
      "revId": "9ff20929e841a9514e6917db7ad1f3527ecd69a6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
