      "writtenOn": "2015-11-07T04:14:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shorter: Use try-with-resources which removes the need for the finally block and makes the rest shorter:\n\ntry (XmlResourceParser parser \u003d mContext.getResources().getXml(...)) {\n} catch (..)",
