        "id": 1018773
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-11-07T04:14:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Suggestion: replace all \"throw new ParserException(parser, ...)\" with \"throw parserException(...)\". This\u0027ll enable you to reduce verbosity and usefully add not just the position information but also the ID and/or name of the XML resource. Overall, this\u0027ll make exceptions easier to interpret for the developer.",
      "revId": "9ff20929e841a9514e6917db7ad1f3527ecd69a6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
