      "author": {
        "id": 1018773
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-11-07T04:14:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You should also throw if the digest is of the wrong length. Such a digest can\u0027t ever match and thus is definitely a mistake that should be caught early on.",
